      "snippet": "- **Ursache:** UND_ERR_SOCKET (IPv4 Socket Error) – Netzwerkproblem auf Server-Level - Telegram Bot: @ogLobster_bot - Workaround: Gateway restart behebt es temporär ## Heartbeat Session Summary (17.04 - 18.04) - **17.04 ~16:50:** Telegram polling stall (first occurrence) - **17.04 ~17:00:** Gateway restart + `openclaw doctor --fix` (TTS legacy keys migrated) - **18.04 07:10:** Second Telegram stall detected, gateway restarted - **18.04 10:28-11:45:** Multiple gateway restarts, Telegram still not connecting - **18.04 ~11:30:** Telegram watchdog v1-v4 created and iterated (false restart loops) - **18.04 ~11:38:** **ROOT CAUSE FOUND:** `409 Conflict: terminated by other getUpdates request` -",
